Some arguments are missing!
Usage: genstree -k K -t T -h H [-j -l L -d -p P]
  --help  Print this message
  -j      Print only the leaf count
  -l L    Print the L-th leaf
  -d      Print the tree in DOT format
  -p P    Print the partition at p-level P
With -p or no output option, leaf labels are printed.
